# ==============================================================================
# NavaRoute Environment Configuration Example (copy to '.env' for local runs)
# NEVER commit your actual '.env' file or secret tokens to Git!
# ==============================================================================

# NVIDIA NIM API key for the Autonomous Subscription Discovery Agent
# Obtain from: https://build.nvidia.com/
NVIDIA_API_KEY=<your-nvidia-api-key>

# Optional: override the default AI search/discovery NIM model
# Default: stepfun-ai/step-5-preview (sent with reasoning_effort=high; reasoning_effort is not sent to other models)
# NVIDIA_MODEL=stepfun-ai/step-5-preview

# OpenRouter is the DEFAULT provider for discovery when its key is set.
# Default model: thinkingmachines/inkling-2-small:free (Inkling 2 Small,
# free — $0/token, 1M context). Free-tier limits: 20 req/min, 50 req/day
# unless $10+ credits were ever bought (then 1,000/day). Discovery can
# request up to 500 API calls per run, so a free key alone can hit the
# daily cap; NVIDIA is the automatic fallback when its key is set.
# Obtain a key from: https://openrouter.ai/keys (keys start with sk-or-v1-)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<your-openrouter-api-key>
# Optional: DISCOVERY_PROVIDER=nvidia | openrouter | auto (default auto = openrouter if its key is set)
# Optional: OPENROUTER_MODEL=thinkingmachines/inkling-2-small:free
